<p>Focusing your hate, you strike your foe with unseen force for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">171, 231, 277, 316, 350</acronym> damage and 2 knockback.</p><p>In addition, your ability to channel force with this talent increases all critical damage by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4%, 7%, 10%, 12%, 15%</acronym> (currently: 0%)</p><p>Damage increases with your Mindpower.</p>